```plantuml
@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 90

actor "Customer" as customer
actor "Admin" as admin
actor "Chef" as chef
actor "Courier" as courier

component "Customer App\n(Web/Mobile)" as App

component "Menu & Customization" as MenuComp
component "Order Management" as OrderComp
component "Payment Gateway" as PayComp
component "Delivery & Tracking" as TrackComp

database "Database" as DB

interface "IMenu" as IMenu
interface "IOrder" as IOrder
interface "IPayment" as IPay
interface "ITracking" as ITrack

MenuComp -up- IMenu
OrderComp -up- IOrder
PayComp -up- IPay
TrackComp -up- ITrack

customer --> App

App ..> IMenu : choose ingredients,\nsee price
App ..> IOrder : create order\n(ingredients, delivery)
App ..> IPay : pay for order
App ..> ITrack : check order status

OrderComp ..> IMenu : validate ingredients,\ncalculate price
OrderComp ..> IPay : request payment
OrderComp ..> ITrack : hand over to courier

MenuComp --> DB : menu, prices
OrderComp --> DB : orders
TrackComp --> DB : statuses

admin --> IMenu : manage menu & prices
chef --> IOrder : cook order
courier --> ITrack : update delivery status

@enduml
```